                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The partisan budget bill will not only cut Medicaid by $800 billion but now we know from the non-partisan budget office that it will trigger an automatic $500 billion cut to MEDICARE. \n\nThis bill is gutting Americans\u2019 health care to pay for a tax-cut for the ultra-wealthy.",
