                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Instead of working together to lower costs, the House GOP just jammed through a hyper-partisan budget bill overnight which attacks Medicaid, Medicare, & food assistance in order to extend tax breaks for the ultra wealthy. The net result: the largest deficit increase in history.\n\nThere\u2019s a better bipartisan way forward. Balance the tax system so the top 1% and top .01% pay their fair share, reduce the national debt, and strengthen health care and food programs so Americans who are struggling with the high cost of living can get by.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
