                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Standing room only at my town hall in Madison last night. Thank you to everyone who joined. \n\nPeople are seriously concerned about the 10-year partisan budget bill and its cuts to Medicaid, Medicare, and the ACA. The fight is not over in Congress. There's a better path forward. https://t.co/UjvHscQg4n",
