                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The cuts to Medicaid in the misnamed \"One Big Beautiful Bill\" are getting WORSE in the Senate version of the bill. I visited Lawrence + Memorial hospital in New London to hear how these cuts will impact services. 40% of L+M patients are covered by Medicaid.\n\nAs the American Hospital Association stated, these cuts will take health coverage away from millions nationwide and \"strain emergency departments as they become the family doctor to millions of newly uninsured people... the proposal will force hospitals to reconsider services or potentially close.\" It's not fear mongering. L+M and hospitals all across the country are dumbfounded at these cuts. H.R. 1 needs to be stopped.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1750454157,
                "view_count": 516
