                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This week, I met with the Connecticut Nurses Association, who earnestly stressed how much health care providers rely on strong federal Medicaid funding. As they bluntly stated, Medicaid pays for nurses. We must stop the massive Medicaid cuts in the misnamed \u201cBig Beautiful Bill\u201d. https://t.co/3JafAdGvOB",
                "text_lang": "en",
