                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "President Trump promised that he would \u201clove and cherish\u201d Medicaid and Medicare. \n\nNow, he just signed into law the largest cut to Medicaid in U.S. history in a bill that is so fiscally irresponsible, it will also trigger a $500 billion cut to Medicare. All to give the rich a tax break. \n\nA flagrant violation of the American people\u2019s trust.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
