                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "President Trump promised to \u201clove and cherish\u201d Medicaid. Well, he just signed into law the largest Medicaid cut in U.S. history \u2013 nearly $1 trillion. \n\nNot a lot of \"love\" for hospitals, seniors, and kids who will take the hit with loss of coverage. https://t.co/VH8Y9aMKjE",
