                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "President Trump\u2019s \u201cBig Beautiful Bill\u201d failed to extend Affordable Care Act subsidies and sharply narrowed enrollment. As a result, the CT Insurance Department has warned that ACA premiums for many will increase as much as 75% next year. I\u2019m a co-sponsor of the Health Care Affordability Act to avoid this disaster for millions of Americans. Congress must act.",
