                "text": "Thanks to everyone who joined my town hall today at Juniper Hill Village in Storrs. People are concerned about the Trump Administration's cuts to Medicaid and housing assistance programs. These are bedrock programs to meet people's needs. I won't stop fighting to protect them. https://t.co/gDNGo77AB0",
