                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Local health care providers are facing the real consequences of the nearly $1 trillion in cuts to health care in President Trump\u2019s \u201cBig Beautiful Bill\u201d.\n\nI visited Vernon Rehabilitation and Healthcare Center to hear the harmful impacts of these cuts on patients, services, and staff.",
