                "source": "Twitter Media Studio",
                "text": "Health care is heading for a crisis. Hospitals, doctors, & patient groups are warning us of looming costs. We just had the chance to protect patients & stabilize coverage, but the GOP majority chose to end longstanding insurance premium support in their partisan funding bill. https://t.co/EA80p40aqB",
