                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Medicaid cuts in President Trump\u2019s \u201cBig Beautiful Bill\u201d will hit families with children with disabilities particularly hard.\n\nIn Westbrook, I visited Luminibility\u2019s \u201cBirth to Three\u201d program, which provides essential early intervention services for children with disabilities, paid for by Medicaid. These services are now at risk under the President's bill, all so the ultra-wealthy can get a tax break. I\u2019m fighting to reverse these cuts, protect services, and lower health care costs.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
