                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Nursing homes and their residents rely on Medicaid, HUSKY in CT. Under the Medicaid cuts in the \"Big Beautiful Bill\", they know that staffing levels and patient care, which are already under financial stress, will be devastated. \n\nI met with Parkway Pavilion Health and Rehab Center in Enfield to discuss the urgent need for Congress to reverse these cuts.",
