                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Home health care is already struggling. Now, the huge health care cuts in President Trump\u2019s \u201cBig Beautiful Bill\u201d will strip back services even further. \n\nI met with Day Kimball Health to discuss their Healthcare at Home division, which provides care for patients across northeastern CT. \n\nThere are always more patients to serve, but as a result of Trump Administration cuts, reaching them will only get harder.",
